<item><title>Ramaphosa to deliver eulogy at Mlambo-Ngcuka’s state funeral</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/ramaphosa-to-deliver-eulogy-at-mlambo-ngcuka-s-state-funeral-88fded/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/ramaphosa-to-deliver-eulogy-at-mlambo-ngcuka-s-state-funeral-88fded/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>South Africa’s first female deputy president will receive Category 2 honours, including military ceremonies, at a service in the Eastern Cape.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:53:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Floods wash away shacks and close roads in Gauteng and Mpumalanga</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/floods-wash-away-shacks-and-close-roads-in-gauteng-and-c92274/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/floods-wash-away-shacks-and-close-roads-in-gauteng-and-c92274/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>Storm damage flooded informal settlements, disrupted public services and left a bridge on the R542 near Boomplaas damaged.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:22:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mulder’s 100 and seven wickets power South Africa to 2-0 series win</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/mulder-s-100-and-seven-wickets-power-south-africa-to-2-0-b8ec09/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/mulder-s-100-and-seven-wickets-power-south-africa-to-2-0-b8ec09/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The all-rounder became the first South African to score a century and take seven wickets in one Test innings, beating Bangladesh in Centurion.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:32:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Western Cape High Court sets aside Phala Phala report</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/western-cape-high-court-sets-aside-phala-phala-report-86d1f3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/western-cape-high-court-sets-aside-phala-phala-report-86d1f3/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The ruling halts the report that had cleared the way for Parliament’s impeachment proceedings against President Cyril Ramaphosa.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/western-cape-high-court-sets-aside-phala-phala-report-86d1f3/share.jpg" length="41828" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/western-cape-high-court-sets-aside-phala-phala-report-86d1f3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
